The proprietor of the AnarchyPPL is Geoff Dale, who has taken the title
Anarch. Anarch seems to be a perfect choice for a person who wishes to rule
as little as possible.

AnarchyPPL (PPL-A) Protections:
-------------------------------
First and foremost, PPL-A commits to do what a PPL is supposed to do,
