on 5 to 6 hours per night. The main things I'd do at these times were to
force myself to get up and wake up, as opposed to being woken up by my
alarm, lying in bed, going back and forth between dreaming and being in a
daze (or doze, what have you), finally to be forced awake by nature's call.

After getting into this habit, I usually wake up right before my alarm
actually goes off. Doing this, I got my sleep time down to 5 hours with
little noticeable effect...

