hours before you go to bed, otherwise you can really screw up your normal
sleep patterns (feels like jet lag)... These tend to reduce the time to
actually fall asleep, as well, if taken early enough, to make you wake up
earlier (although you get tired sooner)...

Anyway, right now I've gotten out of the early morning rise habit,
although I've been getting annoyed enough about this lately that I think
that it's time to change my bad habits....

